This product includes code adapted from the following Apache-2.0 projects:

- FireRedVAD (https://github.com/FireRedTeam/FireRedVAD)
  feature extraction and streaming forward pass, ported from PyTorch to
  numpy/onnxruntime in callgate/firered_vad.py.

- TurnSense (https://github.com/Bairong-Xdynamics/TurnSense)
  acoustic frontend (fbank + LFR + CMVN) and the three-class label mapping,
  reimplemented in callgate/turnsense.py.

- sherpa-onnx (https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx)
  used as a runtime dependency; the VoxLock ONNX models are distributed by the
  sherpa-onnx project from https://github.com/arbazsiddiqui/voxlock.

Model weights are not bundled. Each model remains under its own license:
FireRedVAD Apache-2.0, TurnSense Apache-2.0, VoxLock Apache-2.0.
